# What a docker build does NOT need from this repository.
#
# Two Dockerfiles take the repository root as their build context — spike/authoring-cost and
# spike/onboarding-clock — and each copies one file out of it (README.md). Without this file the
# daemon is handed the whole tree first: measured at 2.6 GB over 6394 files, of which
# .zig-cache/ alone is 1339 files and 2.6 GB. That transfer happened once per image, and the
# authoring-cost probe builds four.
#
# Nothing here is reachable by a COPY in either Dockerfile, so excluding it changes no image.
.git/
.zig-cache/
zig-out*/
.claude/
